# Unity Project Foundation

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M1 Technical proofs
Dependencies: `15_PRODUCT_DECISIONS.todo`

## Purpose

Create a reproducible Unity repository that opens, tests, and builds cleanly before gameplay systems expand.

## Tasks

- [ ] Confirm Unity editor version and record it.
- [ ] Confirm URP or alternate rendering pipeline.
- [ ] Create the Unity project at repository root.
- [ ] Apply Unity `.gitignore` and verify generated folders remain untracked.
- [ ] Create `Assets/EntropyTag/` folder structure from `docs/03_UNITY_PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`.
- [ ] Create Domain, Application, Unity, Presentation, Infrastructure, EditMode, and PlayMode assemblies.
- [ ] Create Bootstrap and initial test scenes.
- [ ] Install only approved packages.
- [ ] Create Input System action asset.
- [ ] Add project-wide coding and analyzer settings.
- [ ] Add sample EditMode and PlayMode tests.
- [ ] Add command-line test and development-build scripts.
- [ ] Validate clean-clone setup.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Project opens without missing-package or serialization errors.
- [ ] Assembly dependency direction matches the architecture document.
- [ ] EditMode and PlayMode sample tests pass.
- [ ] Development build launches.
- [ ] Clean Git status contains no Unity-generated cache.
- [ ] Setup steps are documented.

